      "detail": "Late Oct 1 explosions heard in Houthi-controlled Sanaa; Houthi-run SABA accused Saudi Arabia of aggression targeting Sanaa and Saada, Taiz and Amran provinces. Yemen government forces said they carried out 27 airstrikes on Houthi positions in Taiz targeting missile depots and command centers.",
      "where": "Sanaa, Yemen",
