      "date": "2026-10-01",
      "headline": "Medina power station hit Sept 29; Saudi coalition accuses Houthis Oct 1, Houthis deny",
      "detail": "Drone struck Taibah electricity distribution station in Medina at 05:11 local time Sept 29, knocking one transformer out of service without wider network disruption; the station supplies the Prophet's Mosque. On Oct 1 coalition spokesman Maj. Gen. Turki Al-Malki accused Houthis of planning and executing the strike based on wreckage analysis. Houthi political bureau member Dhaifallah Al-Shami rejected the accusation as fabricated.",
      "where": "Medina, Saudi Arabia",
      "verification": "researched",
      "sources": [
        "https://shafaq.com/en/Middle-East/Saudi-coalition-accuses-Houthis-of-Medina-strike",
